  "created": "2018-09-10T04:04:36.186Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When a user owns an object but leaves the instance, Master claims ownership of the object, but they cannot run owner broadcast types on this object. If there is an owner broadcast type, no one in the room can activate it until a new owner is explicitly assigned through picking up the object or calling set owner.",
